# Quebec, base save. On the colony tile (the "fence" strip, left to right, DOS tile-chain order from the
# head, port_bugs.md #1274): #127 free colonist, #135 Dragoon, #146 free colonist, #91 soldier colonist
# (fortified); Artillery #143 is not drawn on the fence.
# Fence icons (#1691 layout, row y ~114-129): #127 x141-147, #135 x152-161, #146 x163-168, #91 x174-180 (they re-centre as units leave).
click 168 128              # open Quebec
wait 1
drag 143 121 27 104        # fence colonist #127 -> Carpenter's Shop: joins the colony and works there
drag 160 119 260 91        # fence colonist #146 -> free land tile S: joins as a Farmer
drag 158 119 20 44         # fence Dragoon #135 -> Weaver's House: joins as a soldier-profession colonist, horses and muskets go to the warehouse
click 312 151              # multi pane: switch to the Units Present tab (soldier #91 and Artillery #143)
drag 220 166 27 104        # Artillery icon -> Carpenter's Shop: no profession slot, nothing joins (it only gets selected)
click 220 166              # click the selected Artillery: its unit-options popup opens
click 239 166              # click outside the popup: closes it, Artillery is still outside
key Escape                 # back to the map
